# Directions in Russian: направо, налево, прямо
subtitle: "Ask the way in Russian with извини́те, как пройти́ на вокза́л? and follow the answer: пря́мо, напра́во, нале́во, бли́зко or далеко́."
thumb: "band \"Left, right, or lost?\" note \"напра́во\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Bigger and better in Russian: больше, лучше","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/43-russian-compare.cast"}

## Directions in Russian: направо, налево, прямо
level: basic

    icon masha size 110 set twemoji x 90 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 90 y 360 font_size 30 hidden true
    icon tom size 110 set twemoji x 910 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 910 y 360 font_size 30 hidden true
    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Извини́те, как пройти́ на вокза́л?","gloss":"Excuse me, how do I get to the station?"},{"by":"b","text":"Том? Приве́т! Э́то я, Ма́ша!","gloss":"Tom? Hi! It's me, Masha!"}] size 1.6 hidden true
    dialogue talk2 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Вокза́л? Пря́мо, пото́м напра́во.","gloss":"The station? Straight on, then right."},{"by":"a","text":"Повтори́, пожа́луйста!","gloss":"Say it again, please!"}] size 1.5 hidden true
    dialogue talk3 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Пря́мо… пото́м напра́во!","gloss":"Straight on… then right!"},{"by":"a","text":"Спаси́бо! А метро́?","gloss":"Thanks! And the metro?"},{"by":"b","text":"Нале́во. Э́то бли́зко.","gloss":"To the left. It's near."}] size 1.5 hidden true
