    card title "Which way?"

A: How do you ask the way in Russian, and understand the answer?
    draw masha masha_name

A: I'm lost in Moscow, so I stop a woman in the street. Listen.
    draw tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: Tom thought I was a stranger, so he began politely: извини́те, excuse me. It ends in ите, like повтори́те in lesson forty-one.
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part Извините

A: Then the question: как пройти́ на вокза́л? How do I get to the station?
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part "как пройти"

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: To a friend, it's повтори́: no те, as in lesson forty-one.
    highlight talk2_2_words effect underline color #8f887c part Повтори

    erase talk2

    draw talk3

    draw talk3

    draw talk3

    erase talk3

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw streets

A: Here is Masha's answer on a map (@draw tom_m w_ulitsa m_station l_station@). I'm at the bottom of the street, у́лица, and the station is up there.

B: First пря́мо: straight on, up the street.
    draw ar1 w_pryamo

A: Пото́м напра́во: then right, to the station.
    draw ar2 w_napravo

B: And the metro? Нале́во: to the left.
    draw m_metro l_metro ar3 w_nalevo

A: Напра́во and нале́во both start with на, so look at the middle, underlined: напра́во is right, нале́во is left.
    blocking false

    pause 2.4

    highlight w_napravo effect underline color #c9871a part пра duration 2

    highlight w_nalevo effect underline color #c9871a part ле duration 2

B: And э́то бли́зко, I said: it's near. Метро́ бли́зко.
    draw s_metro

A: But the bank, out at the end of the street, is далеко́: far. Метро́ бли́зко, а банк далеко́.
    draw m_bank l_bank s_bank

    hide map

    draw q

B: Word for word: how to get to the station. Вокза́л is from lesson thirty-four, here in the on-the-way form of lesson twenty-seven: на вокза́л, not на вокза́ле. Tom isn't there yet.
    highlight q_w_3 q_w_4 effect underline color #8f887c

    draw c_bank r1

A: Swap the place, with its own в or на, and keep the (@draw c_shop r2@) rest: как пройти́ в банк, как пройти́ в магази́н?

    draw c_school r3

B: A she-word takes the у of lesson twenty-seven: как пройти́ в шко́лу?
    highlight r3 effect underline color #3f7d4e part у$

A: So one question, как пройти́ plus the plac (@draw dirs@)e, and three words back: пря́мо, напра́во, нале́во.

    hide page_c

    icon arr_l size 150 set twemoji x 300 y 470 or ["leftwards arrow"] icon_look picture of "left arrow"
    icon arr_u size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["upwards arrow"] icon_look picture of "up arrow"
    icon arr_r size 150 set twemoji x 700 y 470 or ["rightwards arrow"] icon_look picture of "right arrow"
    parallel true

    ask "Masha says нале́во. Tap the way to go." choose ["arr_l","arr_u","arr_r"] answer arr_l reveal нале́во reveal_at.x 300 reveal_at.y 330 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Нале́во: to the left.
        wrong: Look at the middle of the word: напра́во has пра, right; нале́во has ле, left.

    erase arr_l arr_u arr_r question_1_stamp

    icon qi_tom size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man

    quiz "Tom needs the way, so he stops a stranger. What does he say first?" reveal.text Извини́те! reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Polite, with ите, for someone you don't know.
        wrong: One of these is goodbye and one is thanks. Which one opens?
        * Пока́!
        + Извини́те!
        * Спаси́бо!

    erase qi_tom question_2_stamp

    icon qi_station size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["train","railway car"] icon_look picture of station

    ask "Finish Tom's question for the station: Как пройти́ на ___?" answer ["вокзал"] reveal.text "Как пройти́ на вокза́л?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Вокза́л: on the way there, it stays as it is.
        wrong: The station, from lesson thirty-four. You're on the way, so no ending.

    erase qi_station question_3_stamp

    icon qi_school size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["school building","classical building"] icon_look picture of school

    quiz "Now you want the school, шко́ла. Как пройти́ в ___?" reveal.text "Как пройти́ в шко́лу?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: On the way, the а of шко́ла becomes у.
        wrong: You're not there yet. What does an а-word do on the way?
        * шко́ла
        * шко́ле
        + шко́лу

    erase qi_school question_4_stamp

    icon qi_metro size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["station","train"] icon_look picture of metro

    ask "The metro is just round the corner. Type the word for near: Метро́ ___." answer ["близко"] reveal.text "Метро́ бли́зко." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Бли́зко: near. Far is далеко́.
        wrong: Not далеко́, which is far; the other one, starting with б.

    erase qi_metro question_5_stamp

    show map

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: Пря́мо, пото́м напра́во… Вокза́л! Спаси́бо, Ма́ша! Пока́!
    blocking false

    move tom_m duration 1.6 to [500,435]

    move tom_m duration 1.6 to [860,470]

    pause 1

